{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "1", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "μουσάων ἄρχωμαι Ἀπόλλωνός τε Διός τε·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "2", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐκ γὰρ Μουσάων καὶ ἑκηβόλου Ἀπόλλωνος"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "3", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἄνδρες ἀοιδοὶ ἔασιν ἐπὶ χθονὶ καὶ κιθαρισταί,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "4", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐκ δὲ Διὸς βασιλῆες· ὃ δʼ ὄλβιος, ὅν τινα Μοῦσαι"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "5", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "φίλωνται· γλυκερή οἱ ἀπὸ στόματος ῥέει αὐδή."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "6", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "χαίρετε, τέκνα Διός, καὶ ἐμὴν τιμήσατʼ ἀοιδήν·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-musas-et-apollinem", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "7", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αὐτὰρ ἐγὼν ὑμέων τε καὶ ἄλλης μνήσομʼ ἀοιδῆς."}
